[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m - D is not reachable from B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m - So:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m   - A:0, B:0, C:1, D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m #### 3. Perturb(D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m - D is directly perturbed (D:0)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m - D → A → B → C
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m - So, D affects A, B, and C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m - Therefore:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m   - A:1, B:1, C:1, D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3976819)[0m 
